<title>UK: Zalakeramia issues 120,420 more shrs via greenshoe.</title>
<headline>Zalakeramia issues 120,420 more shrs via greenshoe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian tile maker Zalakeramia Rt has issued a further 120,420 shares after exercising the greenshoe option linked to its offering of 1,042,800 shares in May, Credit Suisse First Boston said on Thursday as arranger.</p>
<p>Zalakeramia shares were quoted at 7,600 forints while its GDRs were trading at $8.35.</p>
<p>The May share offering was priced at 7,000 forints or $7.67.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
